<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Dataset Statistics</h2>

<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">LongMemEval.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LongMemEval <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wu et al., 2024</a>)</cite> is a large-scale benchmark designed to evaluate five core memory abilities of LLM-based chat assistants: information extraction, multi-session reasoning, temporal reasoning, knowledge updates, and abstention. It contains <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">500 curated questions</span> embedded in user–assistant dialogues of varying length and complexity. Each question is annotated with its type and aligned with corresponding sessions that provide supporting evidence. The distribution of question types includes: 70 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">single-session-user</span>, 56 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">single-session-assistant</span>, 30 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">single-session-preference</span>, 133 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">multi-session</span>, 78 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">knowledge-update</span>, and 133 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">temporal-reasoning</span>. For example, a <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">single-session-user</span> question is:</p>
<blockquote id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_quote">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Question: What degree did I graduate with?</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Answer: Business Administration</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Question_Type: single-session-user</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Question_Date: 2023/05/30 (Tue) 23:40</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evidence: Session ID [answer_280352e9]</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</blockquote>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">This benchmark presents a challenging setting where existing long-context LLMs and commercial chat assistants show significant accuracy degradation when information must be recalled across extended interactions.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">LoCoMo.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LoCoMo <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Maharana et al., 2024</a>)</cite> is a very long-term conversational benchmark generated via a machine–human pipeline that grounds multi-session dialogues on personas and temporal event graphs. Each conversation averages 300 turns and 9K tokens across up to 35 sessions, and some dialogues incorporate multimodal interactions (e.g., image sharing and reactions). To ensure computational feasibility, we randomly sample <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">500 questions</span> from the full set of 1,986 annotated questions. These questions are distributed across four categories: 156 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">single-hop</span>, 133 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">multi-hop</span>, 133 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">temporal reasoning</span>, and 78 <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">open-domain knowledge</span>. For example, a <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">temporal reasoning</span> question is:</p>
<blockquote id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_quote">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Question: Which country was Jolene located in during the last week of August 2023?</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Answer: Brazil</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Question_Type: temporal reasoning</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evidence: Dialogue ID [D23:1]</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</blockquote>
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Experiments on LoCoMo highlight the difficulty of modeling long-range temporal and causal dynamics, where long-context LLMs and RAG systems still lag behind human performance.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To facilitate reproducibility, we provide the full set of prompts used in our experiments. These include the
<span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Response Prompt</span> (Appendix <a href="#A2.SS1" title="B.1 Response Prompt ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>), <span id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Evaluation Prompt</span> (Appendix <a href="#A2.SS2" title="B.2 Evaluation Prompt ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.2</span></a>), <span id="A2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Summary Prompt</span> (Appendix <a href="#A2.SS3" title="B.3 Summary Prompt ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.3</span></a>), <span id="A2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Fact Prompt</span> (Appendix <a href="#A2.SS4" title="B.4 Fact Prompt ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.4</span></a>), and <span id="A2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Insight Prompt</span> (Appendix <a href="#A2.SS5" title="B.5 Insight Prompt ‣ Appendix B Prompts ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.5</span></a>), which are designed for response generation, model evaluation, dialogue summarization, fact extraction, and insight generation, respectively.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Response Prompt</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="53.84" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 53.84" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,53.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 50.38 C 0 52.29 1.55 53.84 3.46 53.84 L 546.54 53.84 C 548.45 53.84 550 52.29 550 50.38 L 550 3.46 C 550 1.55 548.45 0 546.54 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 32.4 L 549.31 32.4 L 549.31 3.46 C 549.31 1.93 548.07 0.69 546.54 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 39.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.29em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="460.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.29em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_indent">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt B.1: </span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Response Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 13.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.28em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.76" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="529.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.28em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">---</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Role</span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">---</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline">
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">helpful</span><span id="lstnumberx3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx3.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">responding</span><span id="lstnumberx3.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx3.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">questions</span><span id="lstnumberx3.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">about</span><span id="lstnumberx3.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">data</span><span id="lstnumberx3.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">provided</span><span id="lstnumberx3.22" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx4" class="ltx_listingline">
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">---</span><span id="lstnumberx5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Goal</span><span id="lstnumberx5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">---</span>
