</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Case Studies</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide case studies on both LongMemEval (Appendix <a href="#A3.SS1" title="C.1 A Case Study on LongMemEval ‣ Appendix C Case Studies ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>) and LoCoMo (Appendix <a href="#A3.SS2" title="C.2 A Case Study on LoCoMo ‣ Appendix C Case Studies ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>) to compare RAG-SMFI with SGMem-SMFI. The examples demonstrate that RAG-SMFI often fails to answer questions correctly based on retrieved memory alone, whereas SGMem-SMFI leverages multi-hop traversal within SGMem to locate relevant chunks (i.e., session-level information) and complement them with generated memory, leading to correct answers.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>A Case Study on LongMemEval</h3>

<section id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">RAG-SMFI on LongMemEval.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present an illustrative case of long-term conversational QA evaluation with RAG-SMFI on LongMemEval, as shown in Use Case <a href="#A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="RAG-SMFI on LongMemEval. ‣ C.1 A Case Study on LongMemEval ‣ Appendix C Case Studies ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>. In this example, RAG-SMFI fails to provide the correct answer.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="55.03" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 55.03" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.03) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 51.57 C 0 53.48 1.55 55.03 3.46 55.03 L 546.54 55.03 C 548.45 55.03 550 53.48 550 51.57 L 550 3.46 C 550 1.55 548.45 0 546.54 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 33.47 L 549.31 33.47 L 549.31 3.46 C 549.31 1.93 548.07 0.69 546.54 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 40.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.29em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="460.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.29em;">
