<section id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">SGMem-SMFI on LongMemEval.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Use Case <a href="#A3.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="SGMem-SMFI on LongMemEval. ‣ C.1 A Case Study on LongMemEval ‣ Appendix C Case Studies ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> illustrates a long-term conversational QA evaluation with our proposed SGMem-SMFI on LongMemEval, where the model provides the correct answer.</p>
</div>
