<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>A Case Study on LoCoMo</h3>

<section id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">RAG-SMFI on LoCoMo.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Use Case <a href="#A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="RAG-SMFI on LoCoMo. ‣ C.2 A Case Study on LoCoMo ‣ Appendix C Case Studies ‣ SGMem: Sentence Graph Memory for Long-Term Conversational Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a> illustrates a long-term conversational QA evaluation with RAG-SMFI on LoCoMo, where the model fails to provide the correct answer.</p>
</div>
